### The passwords the stories give (sudo, ssh, repositories, databases):
### words of the language, easy to remember and to type. The code keeps the
### French password as the identifier (mdp-<password>); each language gives
### its own: lowercase letters, digits and hyphens, no accents or spaces.
### The texts that quote them use the one of the language.

